Working on zombie modifications for UnNetHack I noticed that human
zombies don't have the flag M2_HUMAN.

That means that the is_human() macro returns false for them.

The other race zombies (elf, orc, gnome, dwarf) OTOH do have their race
flag set.

Is this just an oversight that it's missing for human zombies or is there
some reason for this?

